************************************************************************
* Parameter definition
************************************************************************
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK OPT1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-001.
SELECT-OPTIONS: S_EXIDV FOR VEKP-EXIDV,
                S_MATNR FOR VEKP-VHILM,
                S_VGBEL FOR LIPS-VGBEL,
                S_VBELN FOR LIPS-VBELN,
                S_KUNNR FOR KNA1-KUNNR.
PARAMETER     : S_WERKS LIKE VEPO-WERKS OBLIGATORY.
SELECT-OPTIONS: S_LGORT FOR VEPO-LGORT.
PARAMETERS    : P_LIST(20) AS LISTBOX VISIBLE LENGTH 20 DEFAULT 'QA IN'.

SELECT-OPTIONS: S_ERDAT FOR VEKP-ERDAT.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP.
PARAMETERS    : P_ROLLNR  AS CHECKBOX DEFAULT 'X'.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK OPT1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK OPT2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-002.
PARAMETERS : R2 RADIOBUTTON GROUP RAD,
             R1 RADIOBUTTON GROUP RAD.

SELECTION-SCREEN SKIP.
SELECTION-SCREEN PUSHBUTTON /12(79) INFO USER-COMMAND INFO.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK OPT2.

