       VENUM  LIKE VEKP-VENUM,
       EXIDV  LIKE VEKP-EXIDV,
       VHILM  LIKE VEKP-VHILM,
      END OF THU.

* Low Level OF Main HU
DATA: BEGIN OF THULO OCCURS 10,
       VENUM  LIKE VEPO-VENUM,
       UNVEL  LIKE VEPO-UNVEL,
       MATNR  LIKE VEPO-MATNR,
       CHARG  LIKE VEPO-CHARG,
      END OF THULO.

* Item Material of Low Level HU
DATA: BEGIN OF THUITM OCCURS 10,
       VENUM  LIKE VEPO-VENUM,
       UNVEL  LIKE VEPO-UNVEL,
*       VBELN  LIKE VEPO-VBELN,
       POSNR  LIKE VEPO-POSNR,
       MATNR  LIKE VEPO-MATNR,
       CHARG  LIKE VEPO-CHARG,
      END OF THUITM.

* HU document from low level HU
DATA: BEGIN OF TLO OCCURS 10,
       VENUM  LIKE VEKP-VENUM,
       EXIDV  LIKE VEKP-EXIDV,
       VHILM  LIKE VEKP-VHILM,
END OF TLO.

